    <briefdescription>
<para>A widget combining a label and a dropdown (combo box) for selecting options. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class provides a labeled dropdown using nana::panel and nana::combox. The label and dropdown are arranged horizontally using nana::place. </para>
